e.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oxWovviScMBHVcATviJF4Z0B86n.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.40759493670886077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"Season 5\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xR3vmpzfzyhiEwaTO2BwUfeHY4a.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2016-07-07\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"How I Spent My Summer III\",\"overview\":\"A little success, a little failure, a little intrigue, a little frustration.  In other words, your standard between-season break for Ben.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-07\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Record Ripoffs Vol. 6 (98% 70's-free!)\",\"overview\":\"…dragging the Record Ripoff concept kicking and screaming out of the 70’s.  What the hell was I thinking?!?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-07-21\",\"runtime\":34},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Home Shopping Channels\",\"overview\":\"Have your credit cards handy because we're about to launch our own Home-Shopping-type channel!  What could possibly go wrong?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-04\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"LaserKaraoke Vol. 4 (+ VHS Karaoke Vol. 1)\",\"overview\":\"Crank it up and sing along!  The madness will naturally follow.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-08-18\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Ben's Random Audiocassette Haul\",\"overview\":\"Oddity Archive®: Now in ULTRA lo-fi!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-01\",\"runtime\":39},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Talking House Transmitter Redux (or, Part 15 Microbroadcasting: The Final Chapter?)\",\"overview\":\"Oddity Archive: Your home for absurd, costly and borderline-useless “broadcast” experiments since 2015!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-15\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Official Oddity Archive Guide To Retro A/V\",\"overview\":\"…because I haven’t REALLY opened myself up to mass criticism for a long time now.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-09-29\",\"runtime\":56},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Betamax\",\"overview\":\"The Archive takes it to the max--the Betamax, that is.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-13\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Conelrad (Halloween Special 2016)\",\"overview\":\"This is your Civil Defense announcer speaking (er, typing) with a VERY important message.  But first, this nearly 27-minute Oddity Archive episode.  NOTE: Yes, I’m well aware that the LP’s discussed in the video have nothing to do with the Conelrad broadcasting stuff—just humor me, will ya?\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-10-27\",\"runtime\":27},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"VHS Vault Vol. 10 (Learning With The Stars)\",\"overview\":\"…because as we all know, learning is most fun with famous people.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-10\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Top 10 Gaming Turkeys (of the 80's and 90's)\",\"overview\":\"Another Thanksgiving episode?  Must be time to unload some more proverbial turkeys (now more cynically than ever)!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-11-24\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Official Oddity Archive® Idiot’s Guide To A/V Transfer\",\"overview\":\"The second (and hopefully final) installment in the Archive’s “Idiot’s Guide” how-to series.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-08\",\"runtime\":46},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Christmas Special 2016 (A Musical Masochist's Christmas)\",\"overview\":\"The most deep-hurtingest Christmas ever!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2016-12-22\",\"runtime\":34},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"VideoGuide (+2 other early Interactive Program Guides)\",\"overview\":\"Looking at the Interactive Program Guide’s especially awkward adolescence.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-05\",\"runtime\":20},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Local TV Vol. 5 (More Local Commercials)\",\"overview\":\"Bargain Bennie is having his all-time biggest sale on local (and regional) TV commercials!  Get ‘em before they’re gone!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-01-19\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"VHS Vault Vol. 11(D-I-V-O-R-C-E)\",\"overview\":\"‘Tis the season for love—and love gone down the garbage disposer.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-02\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Random Kiddie Records\",\"overview\":\"Crank up the Fisher-Price turntable!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-02-16\",\"runtime\":23},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Minidisc\",\"overview\":\"It’s (100% showtune-free) Musical March (read: Audio Geek March, “Musical March” is just a lot catchier) in Archiveland!  Let’s kick it off with a little reevaluation of a format that I’ve bashed in the past.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Ben Vs. The Reel-To-Reel\",\"overview\":\"Oddity Archive®: Now with new Superlife® coating!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-16\",\"runtime\":37},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"DBX Noise Reduction System\",\"overview\":\"And welcome to the Oddity Archive…the show that rapidly contracts and expands—but clearly not rapidly enough.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-03-30\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Ben's Random Reel-To-Reel Haul\",\"overview\":\"A mere 5 years in the making!  You’d never know it though…\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-13\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Useless VHS Tapes\",\"overview\":\"No, this isn’t about those 100 million (or more) copies of “Titanic” and “Jerry Maguire”—useless as they are.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-27\",\"runtime\":34},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Going (Proto-)Mobile! (Sony Data Discman & Apple Newton)\",\"overview\":\"With all this talk of so-called “mobile devices” these days, it seemed worth taking a look into.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-11\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"Video Magazines (or, Oddity Archive: Issue #126)\",\"overview\":\"And welcome to the Oddity Ar-ar-ar-ar-ar-arc-arch-(SLAP)-Archive!\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-25\",\"runtime\":36}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-07-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}